1
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,640
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:12,020
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,270 --> 00:00:17,800
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,430 --> 00:00:22,300
♪Blades clash, who will rise above♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:28,460
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:30,500
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:35,560
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,740
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:44,260
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:49,130
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:53,700
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:58,380
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,380 --> 00:01:02,040
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:09,000
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:15,740
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:18,440
=Episode 6=

17
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:21,400
(Tigers Bring Fortune)

18
00:01:21,719 --> 00:01:23,400
My turn.

19
00:01:25,799 --> 00:01:27,319
I've had a bad feeling lately.

20
00:01:28,519 --> 00:01:29,879
Are you sure the Dongcheng guys

21
00:01:29,879 --> 00:01:31,400
found nothing at the repair shop?

22
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,319
Don't worry, Boss Jun.

23
00:01:32,599 --> 00:01:33,719
The car was cleaned out long ago.

24
00:01:44,439 --> 00:01:45,159
Boss Duan.

25
00:01:45,719 --> 00:01:46,920
I've made up my mind.

26
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:48,680
I'm ready to move in with you.

27
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,159
Can you come get me?

28
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:53,359
Boss Jun.

29
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:55,040
Something came up at home.

30
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:55,719
Can I leave early?

31
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,079
Go, go.

32
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:57,799
Thanks, Boss Jun.

33
00:03:24,919 --> 00:03:26,000
You gonna talk?

34
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,080
Your boss

35
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,479
hates being betrayed.

36
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:48,800
Still won't talk?

37
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:51,159
If Hutou Jun finds out

38
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:52,719
you sold the jewelry he stole,

39
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:54,199
what do you think he'll do?

40
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:56,520
You'd be in real trouble.

41
00:03:57,319 --> 00:03:57,840
Still playing tough?

42
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,560
Take some time to cool off.

43
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,520
We'll come back tomorrow morning.

44
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:05,639
The night...

45
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:06,919
The night Boss Hai was attacked,

46
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,120
I did see him.

47
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:13,479
You did?

48
00:04:18,879 --> 00:04:19,360
Hutou Jun

49
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,160
had been tailing him for days.

50
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,959
He said he wanted to talk to Boss Hai.

51
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:27,480
That day, Boss Hai was fishing alone.

52
00:04:38,959 --> 00:04:41,800
All right. Ready? Three, two, one.

53
00:04:43,639 --> 00:04:44,360
Great.

54
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,879
After I saw Boss Hai pass out,

55
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:01,800
I drove the car to Banzhilan Road.

56
00:05:02,439 --> 00:05:03,639
I don't know what happened after that.

57
00:05:03,879 --> 00:05:04,399
You sure?

58
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:05,720
I don't know.

59
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,839
So you're saying

60
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:12,079
Hutou Jun killed Boss Hai?

61
00:05:12,319 --> 00:05:13,000
I don't know.

62
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,199
I really don't.

63
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,680
Anyone else at the fish farm?

64
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:20,480
No.

65
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:24,879
Want to live?

66
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:25,839
I get it.

67
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:26,759
We never met.

68
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:43,160
Let's put another one on.

69
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:46,720
Does it look good?

70
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,439
Yeah!

71
00:05:51,199 --> 00:05:52,639
So pretty!

72
00:05:53,399 --> 00:05:55,439
I'll put one on you too.

73
00:05:58,199 --> 00:05:58,759
Be good, sweetie.

74
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,000
Go play outside with your brother.

75
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:00,720
Okay.

76
00:06:01,519 --> 00:06:02,120
Go on.

77
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:05,160
Lin! Che!

78
00:06:05,759 --> 00:06:06,560
Brother!

79
00:06:07,319 --> 00:06:07,959
Hey, sweetie.

80
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:15,680
(Dongcheng Tiger)

81
00:06:19,519 --> 00:06:20,040
Boss Hui.

82
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:21,319
We found out

83
00:06:21,519 --> 00:06:23,360
Boss Hai's death is tied to Hutou Jun.

84
00:06:24,199 --> 00:06:25,199
We can use this chance

85
00:06:25,839 --> 00:06:26,759
to wipe out Nanhu Gang.

86
00:06:27,639 --> 00:06:29,079
I have to avenge Boss Hai.

87
00:06:30,079 --> 00:06:31,279
But now isn't the time.

88
00:06:33,279 --> 00:06:34,079
Why not?

89
00:06:35,879 --> 00:06:37,279
We need Nanhu Gang

90
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,759
to flush out the mole.

91
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:40,279
Hey.

92
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,040
Any suspects?

93
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:44,680
After Boss Hai was killed,

94
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,600
our shipments got hit

95
00:06:46,319 --> 00:06:46,959
and our places got raided.

96
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,680
Anyone with that much intel

97
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:51,720
has to be someone with men under him.

98
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:56,079
Dongcheng Gang has too many people.

99
00:06:56,959 --> 00:06:58,199
That's still a lot of people.

100
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,279
Don't worry, Boss Hui.

101
00:06:59,759 --> 00:07:00,279
Leave it

102
00:07:00,759 --> 00:07:01,639
to Che and me.

103
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,120
Lin.

104
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:05,839
Don't push yourself too hard.

105
00:07:06,639 --> 00:07:07,720
Don't forget the people around you.

106
00:07:31,399 --> 00:07:32,480
What were you going to say?

107
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,920
Boss Ji, Boss Mai,

108
00:07:35,199 --> 00:07:36,959
and Boss Tai all lost shipments.

109
00:07:38,079 --> 00:07:40,439
But judging by what was hit and where,

110
00:07:42,199 --> 00:07:43,120
I still think

111
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,199
the mole's in Boss Hui's headquarters.

112
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,519
Are you going to tell Boss Hui?

113
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:50,040
No way.

114
00:07:51,199 --> 00:07:52,240
You know him.

115
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:53,920
Boss Hui may seem laid-back,

116
00:07:54,399 --> 00:07:56,600
but he cares deeply about his people.

117
00:08:05,319 --> 00:08:06,639
Here. Careful, it's hot.

118
00:08:07,399 --> 00:08:08,160
Say hello.

119
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:09,800
(Dry Noodles/Rice Noodles/Vermicelli)
Hello, ma'am.

120
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:10,759
(Noodle/Rice Noodle/Vermicelli Soup)

121
00:08:10,759 --> 00:08:11,600
Hello.

122
00:08:12,399 --> 00:08:13,000
Say thank you.

123
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,399
Thank you, ma'am.

124
00:08:19,399 --> 00:08:20,439
Say hello.

125
00:08:21,319 --> 00:08:22,240
Hi, Annie.

126
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:27,480
Miss, you're so pretty.

127
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,959
Thanks for supporting my mom's shop.

128
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:38,399
Here.

129
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:40,159
Lin.

130
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,559
The people who could've learned

131
00:08:42,559 --> 00:08:44,120
our shipping routes are...

132
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,320
(Cheng Song, aka Song/Collections)
Song from the restaurant.

133
00:08:47,639 --> 00:08:48,879
(Zheng Rongfa, aka Zhong/Driver)
Boss Hai's driver, Zhong.

134
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,559
(Lü Hao, aka Hao/Document Review)
Hao, who checks the paperwork.

135
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:56,840
What do you think

136
00:08:58,080 --> 00:09:00,080
Hutou Jun fears most right now?

137
00:09:01,679 --> 00:09:03,759
That we'll tie him to Boss Hai's death.

138
00:09:04,159 --> 00:09:05,080
Exactly.

139
00:09:05,759 --> 00:09:07,360
His bar opens in a few days.

140
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:11,000
If word gets out that we have a witness,

141
00:09:11,279 --> 00:09:13,279
he'll act before the bar opens

142
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:14,320
and take care of it.

143
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:17,480
So we give each of the three

144
00:09:17,799 --> 00:09:19,519
a different location for the witness.

145
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:23,159
The mole will tip off Hutou Jun.

146
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,360
Don't worry, Boss Lin.

147
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:29,519
Leave it to us.

148
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:30,440
Let's go.

149
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:34,879
Boss Che.

150
00:09:35,559 --> 00:09:36,080
Smart, huh?

151
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,919
Fu's smarter.

152
00:09:40,279 --> 00:09:41,159
You're smart.

153
00:09:41,159 --> 00:09:42,200
Pretty smart.

154
00:09:45,799 --> 00:09:47,120
Mai Gao and I both lost shipments

155
00:09:47,519 --> 00:09:48,879
to Nanhu Gang.

156
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,919
We can't go on like this.

157
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:51,679
Tai.

158
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,519
You need to make a decision.

159
00:09:53,919 --> 00:09:56,480
We've fought Nanhu Gang for years.

160
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,600
They've never been a real threat.

161
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,679
They've never been a real threat?

162
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:05,559
They've held the prime turf for years.

163
00:10:06,039 --> 00:10:07,519
We've been stuck on the outskirts.

164
00:10:08,039 --> 00:10:08,440
Tai.

165
00:10:09,639 --> 00:10:10,279
You're

166
00:10:10,679 --> 00:10:12,200
too soft.

167
00:10:12,399 --> 00:10:14,279
How can you lead Dongcheng Gang?

168
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,039
Boss Tai.

169
00:10:18,759 --> 00:10:19,320
Mr. Six.

170
00:10:24,679 --> 00:10:26,000
He's on our side.

171
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:26,799
Just say it.

172
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:29,879
The day Boss Hai died,

173
00:10:30,159 --> 00:10:31,799
Hutou Jun was nearby.

174
00:10:32,759 --> 00:10:33,159
Got it.

175
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:40,759
With Boss Hai's death,

176
00:10:41,399 --> 00:10:42,159
we finally have

177
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:46,240
a good reason to strike.

178
00:10:47,519 --> 00:10:48,200
Perfect.

179
00:10:48,559 --> 00:10:49,679
Let's wipe out Nanhu Gang.

180
00:10:49,799 --> 00:10:52,080
Hui hasn't made a move yet.

181
00:10:52,639 --> 00:10:54,600
That's your chance.

182
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:55,879
But...

183
00:10:56,879 --> 00:10:59,720
it's strange that Boss Hui hasn't moved.

184
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:00,840
Look.

185
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:03,879
He's not the type to make empty threats.

186
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,080
He either stays out,

187
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:06,799
or if he fights,

188
00:11:07,399 --> 00:11:08,600
he'd call in his men.

189
00:11:09,759 --> 00:11:10,440
What do you mean?

190
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,679
Nanhu Gang hit our shipments.

191
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:15,720
Boss Hui's headquarters took a big hit.

192
00:11:16,679 --> 00:11:18,279
Hutou Jun couldn't

193
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,960
have pulled that off alone.

194
00:11:21,919 --> 00:11:23,639
Boss Hui isn't rushing to go after him.

195
00:11:24,639 --> 00:11:25,480
He must

196
00:11:26,759 --> 00:11:28,039
be looking for the mole.

197
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,519
The mole?

198
00:11:32,039 --> 00:11:33,120
If the mole were an outsider,

199
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,720
that'd be one thing.

200
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:35,720
But

201
00:11:36,879 --> 00:11:39,000
if he's from Hui's headquarters,

202
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:41,200
that's another story.

203
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,039
Hey, guys.

204
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:52,399
What are you doing here?

205
00:11:52,759 --> 00:11:54,440
Show up like this and I'll get killed.

206
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:55,799
Sit.

207
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,600
What's this about?

208
00:12:05,799 --> 00:12:06,480
You little mole.

209
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:08,039
I have a question.

210
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:10,240
Did Hutou Jun

211
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:12,600
plant someone in our gang?

212
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:15,080
Who's the mole behind Boss Hai's death?

213
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:17,159
I don't know.

214
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,559
Don't play dumb with us.

215
00:12:19,559 --> 00:12:20,519
I really don't know.

216
00:12:20,879 --> 00:12:22,039
S-Something that sensitive?

217
00:12:22,039 --> 00:12:23,519
Why would Boss Jun tell me?

218
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:26,840
Boss Duan.

219
00:12:28,799 --> 00:12:29,879
If you won't tell us,

220
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:31,320
I'll tell Hutou Jun

221
00:12:31,559 --> 00:12:32,919
you defected to Dongcheng Gang.

222
00:12:32,919 --> 00:12:34,000
Come on, Boss!

223
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:35,240
Boss Jun will kill me!

224
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:36,240
If you want to live,

225
00:12:36,879 --> 00:12:38,679
you'd better make yourself useful.

226
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:42,120
The casino's about to open.

227
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,799
Hutou Jun is bound to make a move.

228
00:12:44,279 --> 00:12:44,879
And?

229
00:12:46,759 --> 00:12:48,080
He's afraid he'll be exposed,

230
00:12:48,399 --> 00:12:49,639
and Dongcheng Gang will retaliate.

231
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:51,639
I'll convince Boss Jun

232
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:53,399
to get rid of the mole fast.

233
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:54,600
Will that do?

234
00:12:56,799 --> 00:12:57,120
Fine.

235
00:12:57,919 --> 00:12:58,600
The second you hear anything,

236
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:00,200
let us know.

237
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:01,159
Got it.

238
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:07,799
I'm confiscating this.

239
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,240
Continue the game.

240
00:13:16,380 --> 00:13:20,020
(Banzhilan Alley)

241
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:25,399
Go, go!

242
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:27,879
Here.

243
00:13:33,780 --> 00:13:38,540
(Shen Yanlin Says Hello)

244
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:47,320
Find Shen Yanlin!

245
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,360
I'll kill him myself!

246
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:51,279
Boss, you can't go!

247
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:52,960
The casino's about to open.

248
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:54,000
They need you there.

249
00:13:54,639 --> 00:13:55,919
Think of the big picture, Boss.

250
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:58,440
Everything's set, Boss.

251
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:40,639
Go.

252
00:14:45,399 --> 00:14:47,360
I-It was Z-Zhong...

253
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:49,480
who l-leaked the information.

254
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:50,399
Where is Zhong now?

255
00:14:50,519 --> 00:14:52,080
H-He's at...

256
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:53,039
Go! Go!

257
00:14:58,840 --> 00:14:59,639
That's Zhong.

258
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:10,279
It doesn't matter if you talk or not.

259
00:15:11,879 --> 00:15:13,200
Betray Boss Hui,

260
00:15:13,679 --> 00:15:14,559
and you'll pay for it.

261
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:23,600
Go.

262
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:26,240
It wasn't me! It wasn't me!

263
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:27,440
Wait! Wait!

264
00:15:27,639 --> 00:15:28,600
Stop wasting time.

265
00:15:28,600 --> 00:15:29,679
Boss Hui's waiting.

266
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:31,200
I'll come back and handle it for you.

267
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:33,720
You'll handle it?

268
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:34,519
I will.

269
00:15:34,519 --> 00:15:35,480
Let's go. No time.

270
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:57,520
(Dongcheng Construction Co., Ltd.)

271
00:16:01,639 --> 00:16:02,879
Zhong

272
00:16:03,320 --> 00:16:04,480
is such a coward.

273
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:06,919
Could he

274
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,519
really know nothing?

275
00:16:08,919 --> 00:16:09,960
Everyone has a weakness.

276
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:13,200
Maybe Hutou Jun found his weak spot.

277
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:16,759
Something he fears more than death.

278
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:23,440
Anyone else at the fish farm?

279
00:16:23,759 --> 00:16:24,480
No.

280
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:27,320
You think...

281
00:16:27,879 --> 00:16:28,759
Duan lied?

282
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:32,320
It's possible.

283
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:35,200
The day Boss Hai died,

284
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:37,960
Boss Hui sent Zhong to pick him up.

285
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:40,720
Zhong said Boss Hai had already left

286
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:41,919
when he got there.

287
00:16:42,399 --> 00:16:43,519
But Zhong had no

288
00:16:43,519 --> 00:16:44,840
motive or means to kill Boss Hai.

289
00:16:45,559 --> 00:16:48,159
So we overlooked that detail.

290
00:17:10,039 --> 00:17:10,920
Slow down.

291
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:23,599
You've been with Boss Hui for years.

292
00:17:26,359 --> 00:17:27,759
I know you'd never sell out Boss Hui

293
00:17:28,559 --> 00:17:29,400
for money.

294
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:31,039
Right?

295
00:17:36,079 --> 00:17:38,119
The day Hutou Jun kidnapped Boss Hai,

296
00:17:39,119 --> 00:17:40,599
were you at the fish farm too?

297
00:17:41,559 --> 00:17:42,119
No.

298
00:17:43,119 --> 00:17:43,839
I wasn't.

299
00:17:43,839 --> 00:17:46,319
Tell me everything now,

300
00:17:47,319 --> 00:17:48,480
and I can still help you.

301
00:17:51,359 --> 00:17:52,880
I'll give you one more minute.

302
00:17:54,519 --> 00:17:56,359
Think carefully about your situation.

303
00:17:56,599 --> 00:17:57,599
I'm the only one who can save you.

304
00:18:17,559 --> 00:18:18,119
Time's up.

305
00:18:20,759 --> 00:18:21,599
I was at the fish farm!

306
00:18:23,359 --> 00:18:23,839
Boss Che.

307
00:18:25,119 --> 00:18:25,799
I was there.

308
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,440
So,

309
00:18:28,359 --> 00:18:30,799
when Duan and Hutou Jun brought Boss Hai

310
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:32,279
to the fish farm, Zhong was there

311
00:18:32,279 --> 00:18:33,599
and saw everything.

312
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:34,960
Boss Che.

313
00:18:35,359 --> 00:18:37,440
I wasn't involved in Boss Hai's death.

314
00:18:37,759 --> 00:18:38,400
Believe me.

315
00:18:38,759 --> 00:18:39,599
Please believe me.

316
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:47,200
Keep talking.

317
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:48,640
That day,

318
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:51,759
I saw Hutou Jun take Boss Hai away.

319
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:53,880
I was terrified

320
00:18:54,119 --> 00:18:55,119
and too scared to step in.

321
00:18:56,359 --> 00:18:57,160
I still blame myself

322
00:18:57,599 --> 00:18:58,960
for Boss Hai's death.

323
00:18:59,519 --> 00:19:00,119
But...

324
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:02,400
Hutou Jun found me

325
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:04,400
and used that to blackmail me.

326
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:07,200
He threatened to frame me for it.

327
00:19:08,680 --> 00:19:10,039
I had no choice.

328
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:11,799
I had to agree

329
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:14,480
to feed him information about the gang.

330
00:19:16,200 --> 00:19:17,279
He was too scared

331
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:19,319
to save Boss Hai,

332
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:21,039
so Hutou Jun used that

333
00:19:21,599 --> 00:19:22,279
to blackmail him.

334
00:19:23,480 --> 00:19:24,519
Rule Three of the gang code:

335
00:19:25,519 --> 00:19:26,920
Betrayal

336
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:30,559
or collusion that harms the gang

337
00:19:31,599 --> 00:19:32,920
is punishable under gang rules.

338
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:38,000
Three stabs, six wounds.

339
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:41,200
No! No!

340
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:45,319
I was wrong!

341
00:19:45,960 --> 00:19:46,640
I was wrong!
